[{"title":"孟玉涧画瓜","author":"祝允明","text":"溧阳夜燕来仲虚，示我玉涧画瓜图。\n嫣绵生意好手笔，灯前摸索聊为娱。\n尔日南至气转纾，我心之喜君知无。\n黄台离离几抱蔓，野田倘有青门夫。\n焉知大瓞方包杞，含章陨天天下理。\n天地相逢与子起，品物咸章自此始。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52458,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徵明写赠潘崇礼灌木寒泉大幅","author":"祝允明","text":"具区之水被三州，洞庭之树千万数。\n沉森浩㵿天下奇，灌木寒流此何许。\n潘君抱朴山水人，日日策杖独行遍沧浪之滨。\n阳崖众目悦暄媚，忽逢阴壑如有神。\n禹锁老龙铁索绝，拿云怒雨出洞穴。\n木号水呼竹石裂，众蛇从之互盘结。\n蜕骨戌削杂鳞鬣，飕留风叶枸株橛。\n急流抨撞石罅跃，珠跳汞走斗瀺灂。\n微茫上析河汉，注奔赴绕伯若方丈脚。\n山鬼伏窥木客泣，欲据恐被山伯抶。\n仙老时下憩，濯足而晞发。\n招潘君兮子来共千岁以一息。\n潘君归语衡山氏，仙之人兮不可以久留，吾恐一往与境俱失。\n宣州兔肩毛劲如石，深醮金壶玄玉液。\n闭门夜半役鬼工，倏忽移来窅无迹。\n支山谓潘君，张君高堂白粉壁，焚香日坐对，明月之夜风雨夕，仙伯谓我当来觅。\n携君卷图愿写照障入怀袖，与君骑龙返无极。\n馀影终非世中物，谢绝宾客扃此室，门外有人勿与识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52459,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病怀勉之二首 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"郊原行中春风颠，闭门缩脚七日眠。\n惟怀落落五岳客，仰头抱膝作何物。\n尧舜殂落文王没，仲尼寂寞书在壁。\n山川结阴草木僵，驰今骋古皆未得。\n携君璠玙之乐来，黄金香炉紫玉杯。\n烧沉爇蕙降古杰，共听君手奔风雷，颓然一醉万事开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52460,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病怀勉之二首 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"东园梅花白雪深，大堤杨柳渐垂金。\n欲往攀之烟雾阴，美人观道坐空林。\n洪厓举觞江妃斟，素女鼓瑟容成吟。\n我独栖迟卧萝屋，咏君宝篇千万足。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52461,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阊门歌送郭令","author":"祝允明","text":"鸡鸣角乌乌，阊门将启涂。\n船头卒徒拥，屋底翁媪呼。\n呼将儿孙起，来送郭大夫。\n大夫强汝柔，大夫明汝愚。\n大夫饱汝饥，大夫康汝痡。\n教汝兴礼节，教汝诵诗书。\n大夫舍汝去，汝能不思乎。\n君子悦其文，细人念其劬。\n说向君子道，能歌歌大夫。\n阊门开，百姓怀。\n云帆指金台，天王御㝢万国来。\n万国来，仰帝力，王道荡荡，平康正直。\n天子岂不思，思哉建皇极。\n皇极建，若三五。\n大夫忠良伍，志岂在朝暮。\n清风穆如，去者慰，存者怀，穆如清风，怀其存，慰其去。\n穆如吉甫，以永今古。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52462,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"首夏山中行吟","author":"祝允明","text":"梅子青，梅子黄，菜肥麦熟养蚕忙。\n山僧过岭看茶老，村女当炉煮酒香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52463,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦与表弟王制彝卿表甥陈鳌子鱼散步河曲鳌邀饮其室觉而赋之写似二子","author":"祝允明","text":"三人连袂阊阖行，二少年弟一老兄。\n莫言蒹葭倚高树，芳菲润映苍枝荣。\n鱼也有酒旨且多，彝也起舞我也歌。\n渭阳棠杕声相和，明日可如今日何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52464,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲秋 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"年年吟叹到悲秋，心语因循竟未酬。\n日似宝珠轻易掷，道如沧海等閒求。\n爱憎衮衮风千变，今古茫茫貉一丘。\n老子自怜深兴近，谯将双眼上南楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52465,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅情","author":"祝允明","text":"旅食惭工部，分携念孟光。\n岁时临俎豆，风露警衣裳。\n满月当春面，明霞见晚妆。\n情怀宜自遣，看是买臣乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52466,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"丹阳连北固，千里草萋萋。\n东去水逾急，北来身渐低。\n渔舟长宿火，客枕厌闻鸡。\n风景年年是，因无妙句题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52467,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看月怀内","author":"祝允明","text":"看他夫孺作娇称，拟向君王觅与卿。\n想得夜深刀尺罢，推帘独自下阶行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52468,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答钱二","author":"祝允明","text":"病喉少日兼辞酒，养性经年不看花。\n君问情怀看此纸，新诗字字学唐家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52469,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代东园梅见嘲","author":"祝允明","text":"祝家园里一株梅，旧是三郎手自栽。\n今岁寒花开欲尽，三郎何处不归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52470,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京陌上游妓","author":"祝允明","text":"相逢无路避青蛾，十五燕姬细马驮。\n老眼年来观道熟，妖娆知柰石肠何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52471,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"祝允明","text":"非谪非真是甚仙，紫云横截大罗天。\n依稀记得人间事，十四封纱二十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52472,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏都城赁骑驴马","author":"祝允明","text":"紫陌东西苦不禁，朱门饱秣卧花阴。\n知君未是登台骨，休道昭王不挂金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52473,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沿潞河直达淮浒岸柳蔚然","author":"祝允明","text":"?珑翠玉芳阴茂，窈窕娙娥婉态多。\n不是一行千万个，荒天寥落柰情何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52474,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄楼","author":"祝允明","text":"落日照徐彭，长堤上下乘。\n黄楼不知处，洪水尚襄陵。\n客子能怀警，官亭试一冯。\n波涛终古险，来往自频仍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52475,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卢沟桥","author":"祝允明","text":"四海修梁秪有二，卢沟雄冠帝城边。\n下临窅窅疑无地，上接茫茫恐是天。\n紫蜺平飞通碧汉，白龙横卧破苍烟。\n牛车百两春雷过，愁压幽燕地轴偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52476,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"卧病","author":"祝允明","text":"同人相见总相称，一级名阶只未登。\n此事苦难多著力，拙夫甘道实无能。\n垆边岂有升天客，榻上分明坐夏僧。\n一片商颜半江水，尽堪黄绮与庄陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52477,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词","author":"祝允明","text":"黄屋巍巍坐九天，烟云千叠蔽婵娟。\n流莺回首宫墙远，妾负红颜二十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52478,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"儿子续入对大廷感激因赋","author":"祝允明","text":"先公磊落传胪处，老父迂迟失马中。\n未必远寻鼌董策，青箱犹可献重瞳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52479,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"儿子召试馆职","author":"祝允明","text":"黄纸书名已异恩，玉堂观艺复何论。\n持将宣室当前席，幸有丹衷世世存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52480,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"儿子召试后忝窃收录遂蒙钦改庶吉士留学翰林","author":"祝允明","text":"文帝弘谟远，明王懋举初。\n望应非曲学，功欲得真儒。\n给膳摅文思，休朝读秘书。\n养成台辅地，嗟尔意何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52481,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中忆续","author":"祝允明","text":"功名尔已誇雏凤，情爱吾犹愧老牛。\n怅望燕山云海隔，晓风吹梦过沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52482,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追和皮陆夏景冲澹偶然作","author":"祝允明","text":"绿漫衡皋带茂林，林亭遥对接疏襟。\n江涵竹影铺丰席，雨浥梅蒸溽素琴。\n槛水生漪浮澹炎，栋云团盖落虚阴。\n人间最是难消此，未解尘名误道心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52483,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"娄江舟中述梦续事状","author":"祝允明","text":"相慰华堂下，重逢草野中。\n涂鸦犹习幼，策马拯涂穷。\n恩爱千年定，精诚一刻通。\n直能呼共老，天壤有移鸿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52484,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泪 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"昔诵江东咏泪诗，看来别有一般时。\n孤衾独枕斑斑处，半属吾亲半属儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52485,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泪 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"鲁国潸然可柰何，洛阳年少更能多。\n静中怕似奸和妇，换作临风两韵歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52486,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬申夏夜不寐","author":"祝允明","text":"冷暖光阴不尽来，流年五十岂徘徊。\n半窗明月三更后，起步中庭几百回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52487,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦忆","author":"祝允明","text":"苦忆京华更不禁，百壶那解一生心。\n争誇膝下簪缨好，岂识痴翁别有襟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52488,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒","author":"祝允明","text":"对酒无歌舞，看天只咏诗。\n唐贤文满案，半是乱离词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52489,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山","author":"祝允明","text":"深坞高峰处处宽，寻常歌啸等閒看。\n城门欲闭无船渡，却笑今朝要入难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52490,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏床头剑","author":"祝允明","text":"三尺青萍百鍊锋，流年三十未开封。\n藜床且作书生枕，只恐中宵跃卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52491,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"乙亥五月五日王佥宪文明邀宴庐陵螺川驿楼观竞渡","author":"祝允明","text":"提刑玉节照清江，客子游观喜大邦。\n夹岸鱼龙争得水，中流笳鼓杂飞淙。\n国谋幸驻襜帷问，乡思微从俎豆降。\n欲待梅花开后寄，只应迁转忽移幢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52492,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"县斋早起","author":"祝允明","text":"县小才疏政未成，披衣冲瘴听鸡鸣。\n向来啸傲知多暇，老去驱驰敢自宁。\n有物解将王路塞，何人填得宦途平。\n拙谋果是因微禄，好傍吴田晏起耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52493,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归与","author":"祝允明","text":"炎洲闭户赋归与，县尹何妨委巷居。\n夺禄浪言耕有代，旅行谁信出无车。\n空惭河上深藏贾，却笑关门强著书。\n莫道文章误公事，文章今误复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52494,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏作口号","author":"祝允明","text":"道惠何曾惠，言宁又不宁。\n一春眠里过，三日水中行。\n坡老荔犹涩，陶公酒未成。\n哥哥浑不顾，枉费万千声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52495,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题广州客邸壁间","author":"祝允明","text":"故国间居四十年，疏慵虽乐怕违天。\n天应尚念疏慵态，又使閒居瘴海边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52496,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州别表弟赵二 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"江沱已喜干戈定，吴越犹闻稻蟹肥。\n把酒正看黄菊好，凝眸无柰白云飞。\n乡闾讯遗情亲减，中外联行尔我稀。\n幸为经营石湖畔，秫田三亩一苔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52497,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看山","author":"祝允明","text":"岭海看山旅思空，归来还入画图中。\n平生惬性仍知己，只有青山处处同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52498,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冒冷行役","author":"祝允明","text":"谁使衰年冒冷行，几般辛劳几般情。\n重重楼阁深深闭，家隔东南四座城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52499,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宦游句曲偶读丘殿丞寄茅山道友诗有感遂次其韵","author":"祝允明","text":"珠有馀妍玉有辉，鸡栖鹤驭本相违。\n灵飞碧检文难读，想结金堂梦易归。\n颇恨殿丞虚左契，终怜长史入仙机。\n悬知紫陌埋尘骨，绿草茸深白鹿肥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52500,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"句曲道中","author":"祝允明","text":"老至谁怜昼锦明，春来聊得客襟清。\n宵依星斗宫坛卧，晓入神仙宅舍行。\n眼看山多城郭少，肩挑诗重簿书轻。\n何时总入烟霞去，不见人间宠辱惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52501,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伤","author":"祝允明","text":"三年两度哭亡儿，莫怪衰翁舐犊痴。\n谁使为生便为死，可堪成喜亦成悲。\n青蛾怨积兰枝梦，黄壤能酬瓜瓞期。\n等是人间慈孝事，□□□□□□□。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52502,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口号 其一","author":"祝允明","text":"枝山老子鬓苍浪，万事遗来剩得狂。\n从此日和先友对，十年汉晋十年唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52503,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口号 其二","author":"祝允明","text":"不裳不袂不梳头，百遍回廊独步游。\n步到中庭仰天卧，便如鱼子转瀛洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52504,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口号 其三","author":"祝允明","text":"蓬头赤脚勘书忙，顶不笼巾腿不裳。\n日日饮醇聊弄妇，登床步入大槐乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52505,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病卧北牖仰见飞鸢戾天忽然口占","author":"祝允明","text":"海国秋炎紫汉空，一声深入太霄中。\n回看五岳三山近，略望千流万壑通。\n未必綵鸾能瑞世，可怜黄鹄不离笼。\n因思兜率黄金地，金翅擎波护鹫宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52506,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宝梦","author":"祝允明","text":"窗外星河五鼓天，香凝纸帐裹云眠。\n遥寻鹤梦游尘外，却怪鸡声到枕前。\n拱璧光阴悲此日，怀珠奔走笑当年。\n知音总没惟怀古，卷里相看共默然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52507,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衰病","author":"祝允明","text":"半年衰病入秋深，减却肌肤长道心。\n不省门前犹市井，忽瞻墙外是祇林。\n一端惟静为甘味，万绪都忘遂苦吟。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52508,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病閒","author":"祝允明","text":"病閒身懒趣偏长，书策纵横掷满床。\n医业探寻胜士业，闺房清寂似禅房。\n青春总误今何及，白昼长閒梦始忙。\n此境可留终岁月，岂须重觅引年方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52509,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"沧浪池","author":"祝允明","text":"出巷少人烟，林霏四望悬。\n冷光涵曲径，沉绿漾平涟。\n古寺依文殿，高城瞰野田。\n每经思版筑，忘世更怀贤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52510,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日游慈云寺","author":"祝允明","text":"命俦乘暇日，散步入慈云。\n野气能遥接，秋光自独存。\n小山侵竹尾，细水护松根。\n众果都连苑，繁花杂植园。\n废兴徵老衲，文字哭孤孙。\n却幸重来好，禅床许北轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52511,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟过故表伯父王氏宅前有感","author":"祝允明","text":"轻舟独汎午时风，车马当年一日空。\n绿水青门映红树，一时都入感伤中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52512,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊嘉善东桥","author":"祝允明","text":"石梁磻水浸秋寒，一夜霜篷寄钓竿。\n是处风光解题品，江湖莫作旅人看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52513,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"途中即景","author":"祝允明","text":"地迥景逾胜，数程无市人。\n隔篱花脕腆，临水树精神。\n村犬随船吠，沙禽见客亲。\n渐看明月上，夕韵想更新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52514,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即景复为七言两韵","author":"祝允明","text":"临水树如朋合志，隔篱花似女怀春。\n护门村犬还惊客，亲棹沙禽忽讶人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52515,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚上吴山风雨骤至","author":"祝允明","text":"东望海门门忽开，松风十月滚轻雷。\n山眉一点云拖黑，知是龙王送雨来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52516,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赴报国院海会喜侯二葛大同集","author":"祝允明","text":"隔水应霜钟，寻声入宝宫。\n刹那依燄慧，六万绕神通。\n欢喜来侯白，清真遇葛洪。\n独惭文字累，未得此缘空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52517,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"追赋内相吴公邀往书石山中杂题","author":"祝允明","text":"上宰邀书睿制篇，幸从几席向林泉。\n晨陪松露翻閒语，夜傍贤星聚处眠。\n暂拂古风嘘故里，喜逢佳衲过山前。\n儿童日夹先公膝，说向当时屡泫然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52518,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中句容道中喜看山色","author":"祝允明","text":"洗秋零雨向萧神，京邑风光斩地新。\n马上会淹京兆客，天涯忽见苧萝人。\n轻云淡荡铅华薄，初日曈昽宝镜真。\n便欲涉江嗟未得，芙容犹自隔青蘋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52519,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与沈二秋寓建业山院夜话","author":"祝允明","text":"倦迹怜司马，清风遇隐侯。\n乡关不堪问，文酒且须酬。\n水压吴王国，山横建邺秋。\n高台仍可喜，重见凤凰游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52520,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘲客舍山脚下井","author":"祝允明","text":"脚带浑泥气带腥，几家同汲竞罍瓶。\n寒泉只在前山里，笑杀居人总不醒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52521,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽州岁残","author":"祝允明","text":"冠天袖海舜幽州，风候萧森气朔遒。\n双阙日移仙仗散，六街尘滚晚衙休。\n马周卧旅犹观国，王粲怀乡独赋楼。\n未得边关擒虎豹，还思江海弄凫鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52522,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"万安道中","author":"祝允明","text":"历历长亭过眼频，浮家一舸日随身。\n江山不苦南征客，星斗应怜北望人。\n剑匣只依书裹住，酒杯全亚药炉亲。\n床头历日閒拈看，一岁无端半已陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52523,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赣州","author":"祝允明","text":"萧瑟滩声怒复幽，四程犹未是炎州。\n行人不解居人语，章水相逢贡水流。\n蒌叶槟榔须学啖，莼羹盐豉向谁求。\n英贤满路容参谒，珍重昌言日拜收。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52524,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]